WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:05.581
A purified protein fragment can look druggable, while the living regulatory

00:00:05.581 --> 00:00:10.612
complex occupies many shapes and partnerships that a crystal cannot freeze.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:20.005
The therapeutic hypothesis should identify the disease-sustaining transcription-factor state

00:00:20.005 --> 00:00:25.210
and what biological transition a ligand is supposed to cause.

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:33.863
A thermal-shift curve or impressive affinity does not establish

00:00:33.863 --> 00:00:38.176
a change in transcriptional function or a therapeutic phenotype.

00:00:41.925 --> 00:00:46.449
Engagement, conformation, chromatin occupancy and cellular response must be

00:00:46.449 --> 00:00:50.974
linked through experiments that can also disprove the claim.

00:00:54.842 --> 00:01:00.417
Belzutifan, TEAD inhibitors and mutant-p53 reactivation illustrate distinct modes

00:01:00.417 --> 00:01:05.992
of controlling regulatory state rather than a universal method.

00:01:10.508 --> 00:01:15.471
The article argues for designing chemical programmes around regulatory

00:01:15.471 --> 00:01:20.434
states, measured biomarkers and exposure, not pocket discovery alone.
